Merge notifications and a seven-day agenda into Wayle's native dashboard.

The notification card reuses Wayle's NotificationService, grouping, actions,
dismissal, Do Not Disturb, icons, and relative-time refresh. Notification bodies
can expand beyond the native two-line preview, and the bounded list scrolls.

Wayle has no native external-calendar event source, so the calendar card is a
small adapter for the existing waybar-ycal JSON cache. The dashboard's duplicate
Now Playing card is removed; media remains in its dedicated native panel. The
dashboard content is height-bounded so the merged view stays usable on laptops.

